# codes: P1107 P1107 P1107 P1107
file "defaults_duplicates.sp" deck
  title "defaults_duplicates"
  comment " oracle: runs s2a (C1 a 0 w=1u l=1u and L1 a 0 ic=1m show capacitance 0, inductance 0) and s2b (R1 a 0 1k r=2k is 2000, r=1k r=3k is 3000, tc1=0.01 tc1=0.02 is 0.02, X1 w=1 w=2 passes 2: the last value wins)"
  subckt sub (p q) w=5
  element capacitor C1 (a 0) params=(w=1u l=1u) value=0
  element inductor L1 (a 0) value=0 ic=1m ic_mode=uic_only
  element resistor R1 (a 0) value=2k
  element resistor R2 (a 0) value=3k
  element resistor R3 (a 0) value=1k tc1=0.02
  element instance X1 (a 0) model=sub params=(w=2)
